-- Phase 2 — Tee + per-hole yardage seed for Red / Blue / Black, plus a Bone Valley
-- placeholder tee.
--
-- SOURCE (hand-verified page-by-page against the saved PDFs): the resort's official
-- 2021 printed scorecards —
--   Red-2021-Scorecard.pdf, Blue-2021-Scorecard.pdf, Black-2021-Scorecard.pdf
--   (streamsongresort.com/content/uploads/2026/02/<Colour>-2021-Scorecard.pdf).
-- Rating/slope/total and per-hole yardages are transcribed from the "Gentlemen"
-- USGA rating table and the per-tee yardage rows. Each base tee's 18 hole yardages
-- were checked to sum to the card's printed total before seeding.
--
-- Four base tees per course are seeded: Green, Black, Silver, Gold. The three "combo"
-- tee sets (Green/Black, Black/Silver, Silver/Gold) are intentionally NOT seeded: the
-- card publishes their rating/slope/total but not per-hole yardages (marked only with
-- up/down triangles), so they'd be incomplete. Admin can add them (rpc_upsert_tee) if
-- the group actually plays a combo set. Par is the course par on every tee
-- (Red/Blue 72, Black 73).
--
-- Tee stable-UUID scheme: bbbb000C-0000-4000-8000-00000000000T
--   (C = course 1 Red / 2 Blue / 3 Black / 4 Bone Valley; T = 1 Green, 2 Black, 3 Silver, 4 Gold).

-- ─── Tees (four base tees per course) ─────────────────────────────────────
on conflict (id) do nothing;

-- ─── Hole yardages (per hole, per base tee) ──────────────────────────────
on conflict (hole_id, tee_id) do nothing;

